   "notes": "Described the pretrained Llama 2 base model, which Llama 2-Chat fine-tunes without architectural change. Configs are 7B/13B/34B/70B; 34B is reported but not released. The paper gives no d_model, n_layers, n_heads, head_dim or d_ff for any size, so these are not_stated. The paper inherits the architecture from Llama 1 but does not restate those values, and the sizes differ from Llama 1 (34B/70B are new), so no size values are given as inherited. GQA is used only for 34B and 70B; 7B/13B use MHA. The ablation mentions 'a grouped-query attention variant with 8 KV projections', but this is in an ablation on a 30B model, so kv_heads is left not_stated. RMSNorm eps, RoPE theta/pairing, biases and tied embeddings are not stated. A final norm before the head is not described in the paper and is omitted from the IR; a builder should check it against the released code. The reward model replaces the LM head with a scalar regression head; that is not the headline model."
  },
